# Pinned SDL2 mingw development libraries for the maizeg --display window
# backend (maize-439).
#
# Format, and every reader honours it: lines whose first character is '#' are
# comments and blank lines are ignored. Of what remains, line 1 is the version
# and line 2 is the SHA256 of the release asset. Nothing else is parsed, so a
# third value needs a new file rather than a third line.
#
# SDL2 2.32.x is the final SDL2 (2.x) series. Bump both lines together;
# recompute the hash with Get-FileHash on the downloaded asset.
#
# The asset name is derived, not stored: SDL2-devel-<version>-mingw.zip, from
# github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/releases/download/release-<version>/<asset>.
#
# SDL2 is zlib-licensed (permissive, compatible with this repo's Apache-2.0).
2.32.8
